\[
\int 3 e^{x} \, dx = 3 e^{x}
\]
\[
\int 2 \sqrt{x} \, dx = 2 \int x^{1/2} \, dx = 2 \cdot \frac{x^{3/2}}{3} = \frac{2}{3} x^{3/2}
\]

