\[
P_3(x) = \frac{3!}{3!} \int_0^1 (1 - t^2)^{3-1} \, dt = \frac{6}{6} \int_0^1 (1 - t^2)^2 \, dt = \int_0^1 (1 - 2t^2 + t^4) \, dt.
\]
Evaluating the integral:
\[
\int_0^1 (1 - 2t^2 + t^4) \, dt = \left[ t - \frac{2}{3}t^3 + \frac{1}{5}t^5 \right]_0^1 = 1 - \frac{2}{3} + \frac{1}{5} = \frac{15 - 20 + 3}{15} = \frac{8}{15}.
\]
Thus, the correct Rodrigues formula is:
\[
P_n(x) = \frac{1}{n!} \frac{d^n}{dx^n} (1 - x^2)^{n}.
