\]

Now, calculate the mass of TNT required to release the same energy (4680 J/g TNT):

\[
m_{\text{TNT}} = \frac{1.75 \times 10^5 \text{ J}}{4680 \text{ J/g}} \approx 37.4 \text{ g TNT}.
